      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHEVRON STROLL (7) had a tough draw to overcome and was game in defeat when only 1.5 lengths from HERE COMES BILLY in second (23.87) at this track. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card last start despite being beaten. Can find winning form. HERE COMES BILLY (4) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by 1.5 lengths at this track in a handy 23.78 beating CHEVRON STROLL. Awkwardly drawn but has a good record over this journey. Has a solid record from this box including two wins and a minor placing. Hard to fault his form and makes plenty of appeal again. MY NAME'S EDEN (8) ran a slick 23.96 when winning over 425m at this track last start. This tougher but looks a leading chance again. YONDU BALE (2) is always hard to beat when he races at this trip.",
